/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 175.50 Tm
(training.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 153.00 Tm
(2. Does someone clearly want it? Bonus points if people already ask you for it.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 130.50 Tm
(3. Can I start it cheaply? The best first offers need little or no upfront money.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 108.00 Tm
(4. Would I enjoy doing it repeatedly? You'll do this many times - pick something you won't dread.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 85.50 Tm
(Then choose a starting shape for your offer:) Tj
