(Grace finished her first freelance project, got paid, and moved on - job done. A week later, on a) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 338.50 Tm
(whim, she sent the client a two-line message: "Really enjoyed working with you. If it was helpful,) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 323.00 Tm
(I'd love a quick testimonial - and I'm happy to help again anytime." The client replied with warm) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 307.50 Tm
(praise, hired her for a second project on the spot, and introduced her to two colleagues. That) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 292.00 Tm
(thirty-second follow-up became half her income that quarter. Grace learned the lesson that) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 276.50 Tm
(separates a hobby from a business: the money often isn't in the first sale - it's in the second, the) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 261.00 Tm
(referral, and the relationship you almost forgot to nurture.) Tj
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 230.50 Tm
(Winning a client is expensive in time and effort. Keeping one - and turning them into more - is where) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 214.00 Tm
(a home business quietly becomes real income. The math is simple: it's far easier to grow an existing) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 197.50 Tm
(client than to find a brand-new one.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 175.00 Tm
(Three engines turn one client into ten:) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 152.50 Tm
(1. Repeat business. A happy client is your easiest next sale. After a job, stay in gentle touch. A short,) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 136.00 Tm
(genuine follow-up \("happy to help again anytime"\) keeps you top of mind. Many one-off gigs become) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 119.50 Tm
(ongoing income simply because you asked.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 97.00 Tm
(2. Referrals. Your satisfied clients know people like themselves. Make referrals easy and natural: do) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 80.50 Tm
(great work, then simply say, "If you know anyone who'd find this useful, I'd be grateful for an) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 64.00 Tm
(introduction." New clients you win more than offset the few who inevitably drift away.) Tj
